ligned with the cursor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T08:53:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928853","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4898730-1845383656384670","game_id":"steam-4898730","kind":"announcement","title":"General Jeon Demo Available Now","summary":"Your Excellencies, The General Jeon demo is out today. It's free — download it right from the store page. New to the genre? Quick intro: General Jeon is a visual novel × turn-based life-raising game set against modern Korean history. You play as Jeon Du-heo and make the choices at every stage of his life — and this build takes you from a thatched hut in 1930 all the way to 1959. The first 21 turns in full — one run takes about 1–2 hours Studying, training, making friends and pulling strings, plu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T02:06:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384670","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4898730-1842212951298597","game_id":"steam-4898730","kind":"announcement","title":"This time, loyalty is defined by you!","summary":"General Jeon is a narrative-driven game set in a historical theme. Players will take on the role of Quan Duhe, revisiting that history of \"loyalty\" from a first-person perspective. This pioneer PV merely reveals the tip of the iceberg of that magnificent and turbulent era.All character names and place names in this work are fictional and have no correlation with real historical figures.This work does not express any political stance and is solely a fictional creation based on historical themes.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T02:01:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298597","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4898730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4898730":"2026-10-26T05:09:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4898730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5258060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4898730","app_id":4898730,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:05Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"15a6c633f6bfcd926c92dc01504fad6895f3f800aafc13c2263cc444156f9e31","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"반도의 빈농아들에서 육군사관학교의 중심 인물로, 다시 일국의 권력을 쥔 대통령으로—마침내 역사의 심판대 위에 서다.\r\n《전소장》은 역사 육성 비주얼 노벨입니다: 턴제 방식으로 주인공의 일생을 설계하며, 공부하고, 수련하고, 권모를 익히고, 기회를 읽어나가며, 모든 결정적 순간마다 시대의 냉혹한 시험을 견뎌내야 합니다.\r\n한 걸음 잘못 디디면, 그곳이 곧 다른 인생입니다.\r\n근 60년에 걸친 격동의 세월, 초가집에서 대통령 관저까지 이어지는 이 길—당신은 몇 걸음이나 나아갈 수 있겠습니까?","publishers":[{"name":"崩溃猛犸"}],"developers":[{"name":"崩溃猛犸"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1797069600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"PV-Korean","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1788855185","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4898730/412923209/def2dda17eff55434ae3985686c0f3de16c1aabe/1788854618/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4898730/41